  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Childhood friends Do-Hyeon and Han-Gyeol had feelings for each other, but before they could confess, Do-Hyeon suddenly passes away. To Jeong-U, whom he met in the hospital while battling his illness, Do-Hyeon left a request: to scatter his ashes into the sea along with Han-Gyeol...\n\nJeong-U and Han-Gyeol meet at the funeral home. Between them, Do-Hyeon’s feelings—which were never fully conveyed— begin to gradually come to light.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)\n\n*Note: The second story in the Sachungi: Neoreul Saenggakaneun Bom (사춘기: 너를 생각하는 봄) Collection.*",
